          "author": "Siman Nuurali",
          "description": "When Sadiq's Dugsi teacher can't take care of his yard because of an injury, he reluctantly agrees to help out. To make it more fun, Sadiq gathers some friends to help. Can they care for their teacher's garden and have fun at the same time?\n\nThis is a read-along story.",
